                            </g>
                          </svg>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <h3 class="testimonial-card-text">“Clavix completely changed how we approach our business strategy. Their insights were practical, data-driven, and incredibly effective.”</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial-avatar-block-v2">
                      <div class="testimonial-avatar-image-block"><img src="/images/Testimonial-Avatar-Image_1Testimonial-Avatar-Image.png" loading="lazy" alt="testimonial-avatar-image" class="testimonial-avatar-image"></div>
